# Swelte shell — server-side secrets (never committed, never sent to the browser).
# `swelte dev` / `swelte build` / `swelte preview` load this file into the
# V backend env (real env vars win when set). The chat pane reads API keys
# only through these names — AI configurations in localStorage carry
# adapter + model + run config, never keys.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
